{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "0b54ec8d-aa37-59a6-b038-56f399ee3586", "source_ordinal": 4124, "reading_ordinal": 4221, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "异常天气灾备", "published_at": "2026-08-29T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2075969425702741132/answer/2076197669895251139"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "不浪费你的时间，直接说点现实的——为气候灾害做好自己的应对。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "1）如果你住在临水小镇，河流穿城而过，考虑搬往离河流稍微远一些，高一些的地方。", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 70}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "将来台风带来的突发性强降水、上游冰川融化最终导致的堰塞湖崩解，都对临岸区域有更大的威胁。如果你发现夏天最高水位线太高，要慎重考虑并发洪峰的危险。", "char_start": 71, "char_end": 143}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "2）夏天不要去冰川多、河道窄的山区低陷处旅游。泥石流风险大而又难预测，夏季也是容易突发山洪的季节，要格外小心。", "char_start": 144, "char_end": 199}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "更宜去湖边、海边、草原边这些开阔地。", "char_start": 200, "char_end": 218}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "3）家里常备储备食、水、药品、防灾收音机、工具、防水背包等应急物资，以防突发异常天气导致短期断水断电。", "char_start": 219, "char_end": 270}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "4）如果住在高层住宅，要找个攀岩教学场所，学一点基本的索降知识，获得一些索降经验，以备紧急所需。", "char_start": 271, "char_end": 319}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "自然，家里也要准备钢芯救生绳、五点式安全带、下降器等必要装备和设施。", "char_start": 320, "char_end": 354}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这事全家人都要学，都要练一下。", "char_start": 355, "char_end": 370}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "5）车停地下车库的，要注意车辆防泡水。", "char_start": 371, "char_end": 390}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "建议准备大块带封边开孔的覆膜防水布，有洪涝灾害的可能（例如台风预警、特大暴雨预警、防汛预警）时，可以铺在地下停车位上，把车开到布中心，然后用绳子收紧布边，把车像包好时巧克力那样“包”起来，这可以大大的降低车辆泡水的风险。", "char_start": 391, "char_end": 501}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "最好包两层，以防一层意外破裂。", "char_start": 502, "char_end": 517}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "搜索关键词“鱼塘 防渗”“车 防水淹”“包边 防水布/油布”。", "char_start": 518, "char_end": 549}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "也有大到足以装进汽车的防水袋，但要把整车套住，对司机有些不容易，需要多人协同操作。", "char_start": 550, "char_end": 591}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "6）为房屋投保，注意要有不可抗力条款的规定。", "char_start": 593, "char_end": 615}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "7）要监督所在小区囤积足够的沙袋等应急防汛物资。", "char_start": 616, "char_end": 640}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "后面异常天气越来越多，做好一些准备，遇到了可能有大用。", "char_start": 641, "char_end": 668}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "慨叹他人命运，期待政府出台措施，这其实都是间接的东西，这条新闻应该推动你在这方面做出一些努力。", "char_start": 669, "char_end": 716}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "别光发浩然之叹，干点实事。", "char_start": 717, "char_end": 730}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-719eeb80666454995f0c7c5e25b1f799_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 20, "image": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0599"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：西藏日喀则吉隆口岸发生泥石流，致 3 人遇难 558 人失联，有建筑被掩埋，目前情况如何？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“异常天气灾备”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“不浪费你的时间，直接说点现实的——为气候灾害做好自己的应对。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "不浪费你的时间，直接说点现实的——为气候灾害做好自己的应对。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1b75f8b6-fb94-5014-b728-5a5512454fe4", "source_ordinal": 4125, "reading_ordinal": 4222, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "村之宝", "published_at": "2026-08-29T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/347733613/answer/2076406924296316169"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "因为西方上战场打仗的主力是省长、县长、乡长、村长家的儿子们和收钱做事的职业雇佣兵。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 41}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这些人的武器装备都是自备的，传家的。", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 60}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "中国上战场打仗的主要是村民、乡民和地方根据制度保持的弓手、刀手这类人物。平时不但没有什么家传甲胄兵器，甚至私藏铠甲、兵器还是一种特别严重的死罪。", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "中国武人和甲胄的关系仅仅发生在服役、作战期间，仗打完了，退役叫“卸甲归田”——盔甲还给国家，自己还是一介布衣回家。", "char_start": 134, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "在这个体系里，盔甲几乎和贵族阶层没有发生什么关联。", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 217}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "我们是郡县制，是绝不会搞出“集结全国的村长、乡长、县长出去打仗”这种诡异的事情的。", "char_start": 218, "char_end": 259}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "然而欧洲、日本本质上是农奴制。农奴们连妻女的初夜权都保不住，连完整的姓氏都没有，食不果腹、衣不蔽体，没有自己的土地和财产，一生难行出100里地。", "char_start": 260, "char_end": 332}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "给这群人大规模的发武器、搞训练、还去积累战斗经验、接受战争洗礼、缔结战友情谊。", "char_start": 333, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "打完仗这帮人返乡了，乡长、县长们还有胆子去谈“初夜权”吗？", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 402}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "所以打仗只能村长、乡长、县长们自己上。", "char_start": 403, "char_end": 422}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "我们这个国防体系，是极其不利于甲胄、兵器文化发育的。", "char_start": 423, "char_end": 449}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "甲胄、兵器都是公家发的量产货，用完还要还，到期了直接从仓库里销毁。要不是还有皇家保存一点、王爷们陪葬一点，我们现在几乎连实物都没有。", "char_start": 450, "char_end": 516}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "我们说穿了就是不太重视盔甲兵器，因为我们的统治者离战争的心理距离远比农奴制时代要遥远。", "char_start": 517, "char_end": 560}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "仔细想想，我们的“神兵利器”的传说都是什么时代的产物？", "char_start": 561, "char_end": 588}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "干将莫邪、巨阙鱼肠，都是春秋战国时代的产物。", "char_start": 589, "char_end": 611}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这之后的青龙偃月刀、丈八蛇矛、方天画戟这些不是以武器自身的性能著称，而是以使用者的身份符号的形式存在。", "char_start": 612, "char_end": 663}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "“神兵利器”这东西，必须和“村长自己去打仗”关联，和武器私有化、家传化的机制绑定。", "char_start": 664, "char_end": 705}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这不是一个技术问题，而是一个制度问题。", "char_start": 706, "char_end": 725}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0599"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：中国为什么没有发明出板甲？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“村之宝”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“因为西方上战场打仗的主力是省长、县长、乡长、村长家的儿子们和收钱做事的职业雇佣兵。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "因为西方上战场打仗的主力是省长、县长、乡长、村长家的儿子们和收钱做事的职业雇佣兵。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 41, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "3c746169-4273-5efa-95a6-713e59483f40", "source_ordinal": 4126, "reading_ordinal": 4223, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "鱼翅漱口", "published_at": "2026-08-29T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2075501876695544814/answer/2076229677484618352"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "聚餐如果是为了庆祝点什么，才有必要点一些值得纪念的菜，否则聚餐应该作为后续活动（例如唱k、打牌、打球）的一个充饥环节功能性的存在。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "点的都是家常菜，喝的都是饭酒。", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 81}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "而如果真的是值得吃山珍海味的那种宴席，必然是因为有特殊目的，例如生日、升职庆祝，这样的饭是有主人的，不会以AA形式存在。", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 142}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "简单点来说，吃上龙虾、石斑了，喝上茅台了，就不该存在AA了。", "char_start": 143, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这跟生活水平其实没关系，很有钱，也不该拿山珍海味当AA餐（也就是集体充饥餐）吃。", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 214}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "不是别的，是一顿非主题的图一快饱好转场的饭，不值得这么兴师动众，这就像再有钱出门买菜也不能坐湾流去，这是个做事分寸问题，而不是生活水平问题。", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 285}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你发现这帮人拿这些搞AA餐，那么你还是别掺和了。", "char_start": 286, "char_end": 310}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这些人不知惜福，不知道乐趣其实是有天花板的，这样透支享受，很快就会对快感麻木。", "char_start": 311, "char_end": 350}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这属于“不会玩”的人。", "char_start": 351, "char_end": 362}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "会玩的人玩得惠而不费，而且善于咀嚼和深品。", "char_start": 363, "char_end": 384}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "一花一叶一幕剧，", "char_start": 385, "char_end": 393}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "一饮一啄一春秋。", "char_start": 394, "char_end": 402}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "一道豆腐鲫鱼就回味无穷，吃出回忆。让你忍不住期待一起吃更珍奇的美味是什么体验。", "char_start": 403, "char_end": 442}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "仔细算算，能一起吃的好东西还有好多好多，排队可以排到80岁，心里自然就默认这是一辈子的朋友了。", "char_start": 443, "char_end": 490}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "然而不惜福的人，鱼翅漱口，XO洗手，铺张奢华，一镜到底，却索然无味，而这又已经至矣尽矣，无以复加矣。", "char_start": 491, "char_end": 541}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "下次再叫你，你都没劲出来了。", "char_start": 542, "char_end": 556}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "而这类人玩都玩得这么蹩脚，你就不必对这个圈子里的价值创造有太大的期待。", "char_start": 557, "char_end": 592}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "价值创造能力低然而成本却高，这样的圈子自然就容易散。", "char_start": 593, "char_end": 619}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "换点更懂玩的圈子去混吧。", "char_start": 620, "char_end": 632}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "不用表达不满和尴尬，以后约你，你时不时加班就行了。", "char_start": 633, "char_end": 658}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 20}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0599"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：朋友聚餐总有人乱点菜然后强制AA，我该怎么表达不满又不尴尬？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“鱼翅漱口”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“聚餐如果是为了庆祝点什么，才有必要点一些值得纪念的菜，否则聚餐应该作为后续活动（例如唱k、打牌、打球）的一个充饥环节功能性的存在。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "聚餐如果是为了庆祝点什么，才有必要点一些值得纪念的菜，否则聚餐应该作为后续活动（例如唱k、打牌、打球）的一个充饥环节功能性的存在。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 65, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "c0414eda-9626-5bb5-a2cb-fc4cb699e642", "source_ordinal": 4123, "reading_ordinal": 4224, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "无人不有", "published_at": "2026-08-29T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2076397476643170280/answer/2076579940531692876"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "别相信孙的这篇文。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这人反社会人格。", "char_start": 10, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "对反社会人格来说，“诚实”的意思是“无法经济的推翻的谎言”。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "他文章里一切不产生法定文件（例如对方容易获取的发票、收据、纳税记录）的内容，一切对方如果尝试证伪就必须深刻暴露个人隐私（例如必须脱光了来展示纹身）的内容，都不值得采信。", "char_start": 50, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果你留心，就会发现这篇东西里充斥着这种“巧妙设计”。", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "其行无可取，其心不可问。", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 175}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "对这一点没有基本警惕性的那些兴致勃勃的讨论，其实一开始就建立在对孙天真的无条件信任上，约等于根据秦桧的作文定人间善恶。", "char_start": 176, "char_end": 235}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这一点先说明白了，再出于纯讨论的目的，“就假设一切就是如此”，多说几句：", "char_start": 237, "char_end": 273}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "人格不健全，分不清到底什么才是真正重要的，这样的人有钱、有权，也买不到、要不到爱。", "char_start": 274, "char_end": 315}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这其实是基本常识。", "char_start": 316, "char_end": 325}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "王思聪也罢，这人也罢，马斯克也罢，川普也罢，在爱上都几乎是一贫如洗之人。", "char_start": 326, "char_end": 362}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "人在懂爱之前先有了钱、权，是人生的大不幸。", "char_start": 363, "char_end": 384}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "业障深重，很难扭转。", "char_start": 385, "char_end": 395}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "懂得爱的人不是这么做事的。", "char_start": 396, "char_end": 409}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "heading", "index": 15, "text": "他自以为深情的一切，全是错的。", "char_start": 410, "char_end": 425}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "他要的东西，我这里有。", "char_start": 426, "char_end": 437}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "贵到多少钱也买不了，", "char_start": 438, "char_end": 448}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "便宜到不要钱白送。", "char_start": 449, "char_end": 458}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "稀少到无数人一生都没找到，", "char_start": 459, "char_end": 472}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "富余到无时无处无人不有。", "char_start": 473, "char_end": 485}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "可惜这话说了很难有用。", "char_start": 486, "char_end": 497}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "祝他好运吧。", "char_start": 498, "char_end": 504}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0599"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：孙宇晨起诉景甜，景甜工作室发声明称「对碰瓷说不」，具体什么情况？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“无人不有”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“别相信孙的这篇文。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "别相信孙的这篇文。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1c41871c-00f0-5071-a533-bfe5b051d24b", "source_ordinal": 4120, "reading_ordinal": 4225, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "富贵囚人", "published_at": "2026-08-30T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2076492749390586262/answer/2077033947125621843"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你们有没有想过，明星本质上是一群被保镖、助理、经纪人、客户、粉丝、媒体联合看管的囚犯？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不趁着关在一个牢房里的时候和其他狱友找点安慰，还能怎样？", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 72}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "除非入行前就结婚，否则你让ta们怎么谈？", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 93}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "理论上明星可以用自己的时间去旅行什么的，但你想想什么叫“时间就是金钱”。", "char_start": 94, "char_end": 130}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "职业生命只有这么长，下半辈子就靠这几年，随时随地一个舆情就可能粉身碎骨，而在有戏拍的阶段一年就是几百上千万。", "char_start": 131, "char_end": 185}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这种期间，休息一天，哪怕是在家打游戏，一毛钱不花都会损失十来万——那么大一帮子人要足以让人忠心的工资。", "char_start": 186, "char_end": 237}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "ta们要是像普通人那样谈恋爱，今天去哪看个电影，后天到哪来个小旅游，单单这个时间成本就一人一年要浪费几百万。", "char_start": 238, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "“拍完戏在保姆车上温存一下”对双方都是最安全、经济、现实的选择。", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 325}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "人家要正经严肃的谈，也只有这么个选择。", "char_start": 326, "char_end": 345}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "一个戏里合作，正好谈一段。能修成正果当然好，没有修成正果，下一段必定是在另一个剧合作的时候。", "char_start": 346, "char_end": 392}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "囚犯只能在同监的时候谈恋爱。", "char_start": 393, "char_end": 407}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "要是“剧组夫妻”就“不体面”，这些人要怎么办？", "char_start": 408, "char_end": 431}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "人家不是人吗？", "char_start": 432, "char_end": 439}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0599"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：景甜说的剧组夫妻什么意思？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“富贵囚人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你们有没有想过，明星本质上是一群被保镖、助理、经纪人、客户、粉丝、媒体联合看管的囚犯？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你们有没有想过，明星本质上是一群被保镖、助理、经纪人、客户、粉丝、媒体联合看管的囚犯？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 43, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "9b29490d-e7a4-57a2-8f19-d5c2b9947669", "source_ordinal": 4121, "reading_ordinal": 4226, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "迷茫部", "published_at": "2026-08-30T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/665324050/answer/2076835897245425973"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "年轻人不迷茫，社会哪有希望？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "年轻人迷茫，说明社会有很多条可选的路，而且路都有走通的可能，而不是只有华山一条路，华山五点还关门。", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 64}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "年轻人迷茫了，才会什么路都有人走，每个前线都有人往前突。", "char_start": 65, "char_end": 93}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "才有前所未有的道路被发现，被探索。", "char_start": 94, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这样人类的大列车发现前面的铁轨到头了，才能掉头往别的新岔路上走。", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 144}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "迷茫当然是痛苦的，就像自由一样。", "char_start": 145, "char_end": 161}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "不能带给你痛苦的东西，也无法带给你真正的幸福。", "char_start": 162, "char_end": 185}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "二十来岁年轻人都要到探索部待一段时间，探索部就这风格。", "char_start": 186, "char_end": 213}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "问题是不在这待一段，你拿不到足够的专科成绩，接下来很难分配去向。", "char_start": 214, "char_end": 246}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "别折腾，待好、待足，自然有下一个部门来要人，到时候你想待还不给待了。", "char_start": 247, "char_end": 281}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "早点睡吧还是。", "char_start": 282, "char_end": 289}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0599"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么大多数年轻人都很迷茫？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“迷茫部”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“年轻人不迷茫，社会哪有希望？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "年轻人不迷茫，社会哪有希望？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "fa45750e-5cfb-5f5f-bd13-321f8caf89ff", "source_ordinal": 4122, "reading_ordinal": 4227, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "夺门而入", "published_at": "2026-08-30T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2022835024496530843/answer/2077012636315734150"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "古代攻城并不会有什么特别先攻城门的做法。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "哪里好攻攻哪里，没有什么教条主义框框。", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "攻城部队也不是傻瓜——很多城是因某段城墙坍塌、失守而被攻破的，甚至这才是主流情况。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "城门作为要害部位，一般都有瓮城这类加强措施，附近还有马面，还有快速上墙的车马道，属于防卫最完善的区域，很难直接夺取。", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 141}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "尤其是没有把握守卫城门的守军，往往会直接调集砖石堵塞门洞，以免被攻破后敌人快速涌入，夺取难度更大而夺取意义甚小。", "char_start": 142, "char_end": 198}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "而既然守军留着城门不堵死，自然意味着守军还有主动出击、快速响应援军之类的打算，也就意味着对守卫城门有足够把握。", "char_start": 199, "char_end": 254}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "攻方完全理解这一点，所以对城门往往只留部队看守，以防守军快速出击造成应对困难，实际上主攻方向往往是城门之间的城墙段，尤其是比较低矮、保养不佳、兵力调动不便的区段。", "char_start": 255, "char_end": 336}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "砖石包土城墙并不是坚不可摧的东西，别说挖地道掏空墙基会导致城墙坍塌，在投石机破坏城墙排水机制后也可能因为连日降雨自己出问题，此外还有大量云梯登城这类手段。其实要比攻打守备完善的城门更容易。", "char_start": 337, "char_end": 431}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "城门往往不是被重点攻击的部位，但它是天然的“城池失守”的决定性节点。", "char_start": 432, "char_end": 466}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "仅仅攻占一段城墙是没有用的，因为仅靠城墙的输送能力，守军很容易通过更便利的交通条件重建优势能力——从城内登墙比从城外容易得多。", "char_start": 467, "char_end": 530}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "只有先夺取城墙后进而夺取城门，打开主要通道，让自己这一方获得足够的调动便利，才能确保守军的优势完全消失。", "char_start": 531, "char_end": 583}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "没打开任何一个城门，除非守军已经饿得拿不动枪或者少到找不到人，否则往往不会放弃，并且往往最后结果是把侥幸攻入城内、缺少后援的突击部队消灭。", "char_start": 584, "char_end": 653}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "而突击部队也非常清楚——登上城墙后就会玩命争夺城门，要么我夺下城门，要么我跳下城墙、回去治伤，我才不要在争夺城门失败后还往城里深入，最后被人围捕。", "char_start": 654, "char_end": 727}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "如果你看记载比较详细的太平军战例，你会发现太平军的常规战术就是地道挖塌城墙。", "char_start": 728, "char_end": 766}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "直接攻取城门最常见的场景是追击守方的败兵，趁败兵进门时夺城。", "char_start": 767, "char_end": 797}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "一言以蔽之，攻城的常规逻辑是“攻墙，夺门”，而不是“攻门”。", "char_start": 798, "char_end": 828}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "但夺门是攻城战的终点，这一点是成立的。", "char_start": 829, "char_end": 848}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0599"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：古代打仗攻城，为何非要攻城门，不能绕过去吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“夺门而入”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“古代攻城并不会有什么特别先攻城门的做法。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "古代攻城并不会有什么特别先攻城门的做法。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "0acc13b7-01f6-5e8e-a801-867219041fab", "source_ordinal": 4119, "reading_ordinal": 4228, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "存异", "published_at": "2026-08-31T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://www.ifdian.net/p/91054e5e9e6711f1a9e85254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "举点例子吧，比如张三说“我认为美国比中国好多了”，但你自己持有完全相反的观点，你觉得中国要强得多。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "接下来一般有两种聊法。", "char_start": 50, "char_end": 61}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "聊法A：你开始摆出论据，证明中国怎么比美国强，然后ta每提出一个论据，你就逐一反驳，只是会很注意用礼貌的语气和学术化的语言。聊法B：请ta列出论据，遇到有疑点的地方就请ta多展开讲讲，全都讲完了，你就回答“我明白你为什么会作出这样的结论了，有一定的道理”。", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 190}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你是不是明白了ta为什么作出这样的结论？没骗ta吧？", "char_start": 191, "char_end": 217}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "是不是有一定的道理？——人总是有一定的道理的。", "char_start": 218, "char_end": 241}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你有放弃自己的立场吗？并没有，也不需要。", "char_start": 242, "char_end": 262}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "如果ta问你你的看法怎么办？那就回答“我在这方面没有什么成熟的看法，还需要广泛学习一下”。", "char_start": 263, "char_end": 308}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你有你的看法，但这个看法是不是还不够成熟？——当然，所有的看法永远都不够成熟。所以你也没有骗ta什么，ta也不能根据你的这个表态认定你就是ta的同志。", "char_start": 309, "char_end": 384}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这两种哪一种是友善的交流？", "char_start": 385, "char_end": 398}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "其实只有后者是友善的交流。", "char_start": 399, "char_end": 412}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "前者其实是敌对的，只是一种体面的战争，就像打仗约定不丢毒气弹、不伤害平民、不破坏民生设施。你仍然是在追求对方放弃立场，接受失败。", "char_start": 413, "char_end": 477}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "后者才是一般意义上的交流——你获得了对ta的了解，ta获得了倾诉的快乐，你也没有损失什么。", "char_start": 478, "char_end": 523}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "不要把所有的对话都认定为要彼此说服，必须达成一致意见。这种情况其实很少见，只发生在“双方都在一条船上，而且双方地位完全对等，又必须要决定船到底往东还是往西”的时候，这是极其罕见的。", "char_start": 524, "char_end": 614}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因为大多数情况下地位都不会是对等的，要么当时你是船长，要么ta是船长，要么是各行各船、不必一致。", "char_start": 615, "char_end": 663}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你要表达你的意见怎么办？", "char_start": 664, "char_end": 676}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你另外找一个你做主人的场合，例如你的博客、你的回答区，你的社交网络主页，把你想说的说出来。遇到对方有不同意见，还是同一个应对——问清楚对方的论据，然后说“有一定道理”，然后对话就结束了。", "char_start": 677, "char_end": 770}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "“问清楚论据，表示有一定道理”，就是求同存异的“存异”。", "char_start": 771, "char_end": 799}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "“获得聆听”和“得到起码的认同”是人的最基本的需求。", "char_start": 800, "char_end": 826}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "让对方有一个友好的氛围，把话从容的讲完，不要听了一半就觉得“估计又是那一套”，拦腰截断开始讲自己的反驳，这个就叫“获得聆听”。", "char_start": 827, "char_end": 890}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "对方讲完，最低也要给一个“有一定道理”的评价，而绝不能摆出“荒谬”的态度，试图证明对方每一句话都是错的。", "char_start": 891, "char_end": 943}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "“荒谬”的，只能是你主动立论时专门定义、提纯出来的一种特定论点，它是不能用在人身上的。", "char_start": 944, "char_end": 987}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你可以说1+1=0这个算式是荒谬的，但不能说算出这个结果的人是荒谬的。因为人不止有这个算式。因为算式没有尊严，人有。", "char_start": 988, "char_end": 1046}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "为了避免误解，一旦和人面对面，你就要时时刻刻记住抛开仅仅面对抽象的命题时的习惯，避免“除恶务尽”式的追求。", "char_start": 1047, "char_end": 1100}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "对人，只能求同存异，否则你很难满足“获得聆听”和“起码认同”的基本需求。", "char_start": 1101, "char_end": 1137}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "满足不了，就很容易招致报复，导致树敌。", "char_start": 1138, "char_end": 1157}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "其实别人这么对你，你也一样会痛苦，会本能的报复。", "char_start": 1158, "char_end": 1182}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这不是谁道德败坏，而是我们人类的通性。", "char_start": 1183, "char_end": 1202}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "这其实就是另一种意义上的“就事论事”——把事情抽象出来放在自己的书桌上，那随你怎么“除恶务尽”；一旦面对持有这观点的人，那就没办法，要给予人应有的基本尊重。", "char_start": 1203, "char_end": 1281}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "自己在实践中多验证吧。", "char_start": 1282, "char_end": 1293}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 29}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0599"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：交流中自认较为严谨、有逻辑，但对方说“不就是想让我承认你是对的吗”，如何分析导致此种情形的原因？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029"], "summary": "围绕“存异”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“举点例子吧，比如张三说“我认为美国比中国好多了”，但你自己持有完全相反的观点，你觉得中国要强得多。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "举点例子吧，比如张三说“我认为美国比中国好多了”，但你自己持有完全相反的观点，你觉得中国要强得多。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 49, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
